Brand motion style guide
title end

paragraph start
Motion follows few rules: one easing style, a small set of durations, and glitch effects kept short and rare. A viewer should notice the message first and the effect second.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Rapid flashing can bother some viewers, so the limit must be checked in the accessibility standard before any strobe effect is used.
paragraph end

